  "strengths": [
    "Reference-quality SPARQL 1.1 implementation from the core Java semantic-web toolkit",
    "Runs embedded in a JVM process or as a standalone Fuseki server",
    "Serializable transactions with single-writer, multi-reader concurrency",
    "Free, Apache-licensed and maintained by an active ASF community"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
    "No clustering or replication; HA must be built around it",
    "Single-writer model limits concurrent update throughput",
    "Query performance trails specialized engines (QLever, Virtuoso) on very large datasets"
